 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "Someone has to make decisions here. I'm just saying — it might as well be someone who knows how."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Someone asked me what we should do yesterday. I had an answer. That felt... right.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Still on what they want.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Finally. I was wondering when you'd see my value.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Right. Sorry, I go on about it. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Rafael owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "You show them Jerusalem Artichoke — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Right. Action time. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"What's the kindest thing someone's done for you out here?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Okay.\" Something shutters, just slightly."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Still on the kindest thing someone's done for you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"...I should say, I trade in what I know. My knowledge for yours. Or food, if you're short on secrets.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"I dreamed Rafael was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Rafael said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"We bury, we grieve, we keep going. There's no step four.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "You show them Jerusalem Artichoke — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about what's been happening — we got cut off, 4 days back. 'You show them Jerusalem Artichoke — where it grows, how to tell it apart."
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "They nod slowly, committing it to…' We still owe the kindest thing someone's done for you a proper ending, too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"My part? I remember them. Someone has to do it properly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "You show them Pawpaw — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You're family now. Chosen family — the kind that actually counts.\" \"Make of that what you will.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Rafael always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Rafael's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"I clean up other people's messes quietly for Rafael, now. Feels right. Feels like the least I can do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "You show them Pawpaw — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"I've got fires to light — metaphorical ones. Mostly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"What did you do for fun? Before. The thing you'd do on a perfect Saturday.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"The free things. Turns out they were the expensive ones. Hm.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Still on what you did for fun. Don't look away from this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"I'd love to. Lead the way.\" (They're already checking your pack.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "Mara shows you where they go to think. \"Don't tell the others. Everyone needs one place.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Impress Us. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Ask me tomorrow. Everything changes by tomorrow.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Hey — I found some Pawpaw today. You were right, it was right where you said.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took you — Impress Us, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"As I said — Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "You show them Mahua — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"You talk to it -- the System. Have you ever asked? About the taken -- about Victorine?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"It's my niece, Victorine. Is napping in a pod somewhere, they say. Seven years old and napping. She was never boring. Some nights I dream about the pods -- rows of them, humming. I wake up and I can't tell if it was a dream or a broadcast."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"They took you — Beastmaster, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Same weather, different day. I keep notes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Real talk — Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"You said fun was just being around your people. Do we count? Are we trying?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Here. I made an extra.\" Mara presses something into your hand — a decent tool, oiled and kept. (Useful. Keep it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"Beastmaster. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I do the small things right. The big things notice.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  }
 ],
