    "giftSample": [
     "💛 You hold Busker's harmonica. Rain, an open case, three dollars and a sandwich. You played anyway — the street owes you nothing, so everything it gives is a gift. You still believe that. Your gifts ",
     "\"Got it,\" Jayden says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\""
    ],
    "rumorSample": [
