  },
  "deathBeat": [
   "d25: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Rafael Agarwal is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d25: 🕯️ Rafael Agarwal is dead — the arena. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
   "d25: The village's quarrel was with Rafael — and Rafael is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
   "d26: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Nevermore is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d27: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Hummice is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
  ],
  "recoverHome": [
   "d26: That night, they bring Rafael home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
  "vouch": [
   "d25: At the grave, Jayden, Ruth speak for Ingrid — \"Rafael trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
  ],
  "systemVoice": [
   "d25: 📺 SYSTEM: \"You took too long choosing. We chose. You're welcome. It was the most flattering one.\"",
   "d27: SYSTEM: Deep integration. You see the world through us now.",
   "d27: ⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 85. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 6.\"",
   "d27: 📺 SYSTEM: \"We have filed a request for the sky to be less bruised. It is pending. The sky has not responded.\""
  ],
  "burialWindowSay": [
   "d25: The village's quarrel was with Rafael — and Rafael is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
   "d25: At the grave, Jayden, Ruth speak for Ingrid — \"Rafael trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens.",
   "d26: That night, they bring Rafael home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours.",
   "d28: You say a few words for Rafael. Not a ceremony — just: you were here, and someone noticed you leaving. (-3 trauma)",
   "d28: You bury Rafael. A marker, of sorts. The village will know where. (+4 trauma)",
   "d29: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+5 integration)"
  ],
  "pendingBurialsLeft": 0,
  "corpseEnd": {
